					<description><![CDATA[UPDATE: This meeting has been canceled until further notice. The Office of Space Commerce announces the second meeting of the Advisory Committee on Excellence in Space (ACES), a Federal Advisory Committee providing NOAA guidance on U.S. commercial space issues. The &#8230;<p class="read-more"> <a class="more-link" href="https://space.commerce.gov/aces-public-meeting-march-5-2025/"> <span class="screen-reader-text">Second ACES Meeting Set for March 5</span> Read More &#187;</a></p>]]></description>
		
		
		
