		<category><![CDATA[report]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://prod-01-east-www-space.woc.noaa.gov/?p=8851</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[On January 14, Deputy Secretary of Commerce Don Graves released a report on the Commerce Department&#8217;s commercial space accomplishments during his and Secretary Raimondo&#8217;s tenure. The report covers many achievements across multiple bureaus of the Department, including those of NOAA &#8230;<p class="read-more"> <a class="more-link" href="https://space.commerce.gov/doc-space-accomplishments-report-2021-2024/"> <span class="screen-reader-text">DOC Space Accomplishments Report, 2021-2024</span> Read More &#187;</a></p>]]></description>
		
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>First ACES Public Meeting &#8211; October 3, 2024</title>
		<link>https://space.commerce.gov/first-aces-public-meeting-set-for-october-3/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jason Kim]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 25 Oct 2024 15:28:52 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[ACES]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Commercial Remote Sensing]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Mission Authorization]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Deputy Secretary]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Gabriel Swiney]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Jason Kim]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[presentation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Richard DalBello]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Sarah Brothers]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://prod-01-east-www-space.woc.noaa.gov/?p=7924</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The Office of Space Commerce (OSC) convened the first public meeting of the newly established Advisory Committee on Excellence in Space (ACES) on Thursday, October 3, 2024, from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. EDT. ACES provides advice and recommendations to &#8230;<p class="read-more"> <a class="more-link" href="https://space.commerce.gov/first-aces-public-meeting-set-for-october-3/"> <span class="screen-reader-text">First ACES Public Meeting &#8211; October 3, 2024</span> Read More &#187;</a></p>]]></description>
		
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>NOAA Appoints Members to New Advisory Committee on Space Commerce</title>
		<link>https://space.commerce.gov/noaa-appoints-members-to-new-advisory-committee-on-space-commerce/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jason Kim]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 06 Sep 2024 15:24:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[ACES]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Richard DalBello]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://prod-01-east-www-space.woc.noaa.gov/?p=7780</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[NOAA&#8217;s Office of Space Commerce is pleased to announce the selection of 17 individuals to serve on the inaugural Advisory Committee on Excellence in Space (ACES). This Federal advisory committee, consisting of diverse experts representing interests across the space community, &#8230;<p class="read-more"> <a class="more-link" href="https://space.commerce.gov/noaa-appoints-members-to-new-advisory-committee-on-space-commerce/"> <span class="screen-reader-text">NOAA Appoints Members to New Advisory Committee on Space Commerce</span> Read More &#187;</a></p>]]></description>
		
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>NOAA Solicits Nominations for ACES Membership</title>
